      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode closes at a transition milestone: the patient/family know the next responsible service, what documents to bring, medication boundaries, wound safety plan, and when to report back. Residual risks are appropriately bounded because radiation scheduling and endocrine therapy timing remain with the treating teams rather than being decided online.",
